## Issue Title
riders/lgtnfght: Objects break when turning on Flip Switch

## Issue Description
When enabling DIP Switch "flip" in Lighting Fighters, scroll and fix layers work correctly but objects become broken and cannot be seen on screen or appear in the wrong position.

This could be related to it being a Vertical game.

Riders use jt053244 which is very similar to jt05346, so check on adding changes in both modules, even though no vertical game uses jt053246 yet.

